  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Lebanon Tensions Monitoring Systems</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to maintain a collective understanding of tensions between Syrian refugees and Lebanese host communities as well as between Lebanese communities using innovative data collection methods, which in turn informs conflict sensitive policy and programming including through mainstreaming a conflict sensitive approach across the LCRP.</narrative>
  </description>
